For those who are willing to do some soldering, please feel free to try out my design. 

Step 1 Download the Gerber File, BOM file, and Pick And Place file
Step 2 Go to JLCPCB.com
Step 3 upload gerber zip in the order section
Step 4 select PCB Assembly
Step 5 Hit next until it asks for you to upload the BOM File and CPL file
Step 6 ONLY HAVE USB-TYPE-C-018 and TXB0108PWR Selected to keep cost to a minimum
Step 7 assess order and choose appropriate shipping to keep cost down
Step 8 Anxiously wait for a few weeks till your order arrives
Step 9 Follow Assembly guide to finish controller and enjoy
